    "Scouting Notes": "Reliever\n I like Strzelecki quite a bit.\n Fastball jumps on hitters, shows good life in the top of the zone, despite not having crazy velocity.\n Slider flashes plus, sits above average with a lot of sweep.\n Changeup is more inconsistent and in my opinion should be used more. But really sharp movement when it's on.\n Shouldn't walk too many batters, has pretty solid command.\n Major league arm right now, should stick in the Brewers pen, in my opinion.",
